  ('P1','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O2','Which of these can a living thing do but a stone cannot?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Eat food"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Be hard"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Stay on the ground"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Be grey in colour"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Living things eat food, but a stone cannot."}',0.3,'{P1,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P1','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O2','Why do we say a chair is a non-living thing?','[{"id": "a", "text": "It cannot grow or breathe"}, {"id": "b", "text": "It can run fast"}, {"id": "c", "text": "It can eat rice"}, {"id": "d", "text": "It can sleep"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A chair is non-living because it cannot grow or breathe."}',0.3,'{P1,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
