  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T1','BSC-T1-O2','Which of these is a plant?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A cow"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A maize plant"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A hen"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A fish"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "A maize plant is a plant because it has roots, stem and leaves."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T1','BSC-T1-O2','Which of these is an animal?','[{"id": "a", "text": "An orange tree"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Grass"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A dog"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A flower"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "A dog is an animal because it can move about and feed on its own."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T1','BSC-T1-O2','Most plants are green because of their:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Leaves"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Legs"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Wings"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Eyes"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Green leaves give most plants their green colour."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T1','BSC-T1-O2','Which of these animals can fly?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A goat"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A bird"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A snail"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A cow"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "A bird has wings and can fly."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T1','BSC-T1-O2','Unlike animals, most plants cannot:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Grow"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Move about from place to place"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Have leaves"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Need water"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Plants are fixed to the ground and cannot move about like animals."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O1','We use air mainly for:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Breathing"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Eating"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Reading"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleeping"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Humans and animals breathe in air to stay alive."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O1','Moving air is called:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Rain"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Wind"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sand"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Fire"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Air that moves from place to place is called wind."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O1','Which of these is filled with air?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A blown-up balloon"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A bag of rice"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A cup of water"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A stone"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A blown-up balloon is full of air, which makes it big."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O1','We can NOT do this with air:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Feel it when it moves"}, {"id": "b", "text": "See its clear colour"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Use it to breathe"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Use it to dry clothes"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Air is invisible, so we cannot see it, but we can feel it."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O1','Wind helps a Nigerian farmer to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Dry his farm produce"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cook his food"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Write a letter"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleep at night"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Wind (moving air) helps to dry grains and other farm produce."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O2','The colour of clean drinking water is:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Red"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Blue"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Colourless"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Green"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Clean, safe drinking water has no colour; it is colourless."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O2','We use water at home for:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Cooking and drinking"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Writing on paper"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Making fire"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sweeping the floor"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Water is used for cooking, drinking, washing and many other needs."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O2','When water is put in a freezer, it becomes:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Ice"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Steam"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sand"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Oil"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Very cold water freezes and turns into solid ice."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O2','Which of these is a source of water in Nigeria?','[{"id": "a", "text": "River Niger"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A market"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A road"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A book"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Rivers such as the River Niger are natural sources of water."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T2','BSC-T2-O2','To make dirty water safe to drink, we can:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Boil it"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Add sand to it"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Leave it in the sun forever"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Pour soap into it"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Boiling water kills germs and makes it safe to drink."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O1','We should wash our hands with soap and water before:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Eating"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sleeping in class"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Playing football"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Singing"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Washing hands before eating removes germs and keeps us healthy."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O1','We clean our teeth with a:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Toothbrush"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Spoon"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Comb"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Pencil"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A toothbrush and paste are used to clean the teeth."}',0.15,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O1','How often should you brush your teeth each day?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Once a week"}, {"id": "b", "text": "At least twice a day"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Once a month"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Never"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Brushing at least twice daily keeps the teeth clean and healthy."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O1','We use a sponge and soap mainly to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Bath the body"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cook food"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Read a book"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Play a game"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A sponge and soap are used to wash and clean the body during a bath."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O1','Keeping our finger nails short and clean helps to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Stop germs from hiding under them"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Make us run faster"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Help us see well"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Make us taller"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Germs hide in long, dirty nails, so short clean nails keep us healthy."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O2','We sweep the classroom floor with a:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Broom"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cup"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Chalk"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Ruler"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A broom is used to sweep dirt from the floor."}',0.15,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O2','Where should we throw waste paper and banana peels?','[{"id": "a", "text": "On the road"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Inside a dustbin"}, {"id": "c", "text": "In the gutter"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Under the desk"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Refuse should be put in a dustbin to keep the place clean."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O2','A dirty environment can bring:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Diseases"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Good marks"}, {"id": "c", "text": "New clothes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "More money"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A dirty environment breeds germs and insects that cause diseases."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O2','Blocked gutters full of dirty water can breed:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Mosquitoes"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Books"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Cars"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Shoes"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Mosquitoes breed in dirty stagnant water and can cause malaria."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T3','BSC-T3-O2','Which of these keeps our home clean?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sweeping and clearing rubbish"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Throwing dirt everywhere"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Leaving food to rot"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Blocking the drains"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sweeping and clearing rubbish keeps the home neat and healthy."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O1','A tool used to drive a nail into wood is a:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Hammer"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Spoon"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Pencil"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Plate"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A hammer is used to drive nails into wood."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O1','We use a pair of scissors to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Cut paper or cloth"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Boil water"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sweep the floor"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Drink water"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Scissors are used to cut paper, cloth and other thin materials."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O1','Which tool is used to dig the ground on a farm?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A hoe"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A cup"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A comb"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A book"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A hoe is a farm tool used to dig and loosen the soil."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O1','A knife is used mainly for:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Cutting"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Writing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sweeping"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Singing"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A knife has a sharp edge that is used for cutting."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O1','Why must we handle sharp tools like knives carefully?','[{"id": "a", "text": "They can cut and hurt us"}, {"id": "b", "text": "They are too heavy"}, {"id": "c", "text": "They make noise"}, {"id": "d", "text": "They are very cold"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sharp tools can cut and injure us, so they must be handled with care."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O2','Which of these materials is used to make a drinking glass?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Glass"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Water"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Air"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Grass"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Drinking glasses are made from glass, which is clear and hard."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O2','A material that can break easily when it falls is:','[{"id": "a", "text": "A glass cup"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A rubber ball"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A cloth"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A plastic bucket"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Glass is brittle and breaks easily when it falls."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O2','Which material is soft and used to make our clothes?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Cloth"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Iron"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Stone"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Wood"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Clothes are made from soft cloth (fabric)."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O2','Which of these materials is hard and strong?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Iron"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Paper"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A leaf"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Cotton wool"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Iron is a hard, strong metal used to make many things."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T4','BSC-T4-O2','Which material soaks up water quickly?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Paper"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Nylon"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Iron"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Glass"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Paper soaks up water easily, so it is used to wipe up spills."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O1','The part of a computer we look at to see our work is the:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Monitor"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Mouse"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Keyboard"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Printer"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The monitor is the screen that shows what the computer is doing."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O1','We use the keyboard to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Type letters and numbers"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Show pictures"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Print paper"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Play music only"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The keyboard has keys used to type letters and numbers."}',0.25,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O1','The small device we move and click to point on the screen is the:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Mouse"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Monitor"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Speaker"}, {"id": "d", "text": "System unit"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The mouse is used to point at and click things on the screen."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O1','The computer part that lets us hear sound is the:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Speaker"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Keyboard"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Mouse"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Screen"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Speakers let us hear sound and music from the computer."}',0.3,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O1','Which of these is a part of the computer?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Keyboard"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Broom"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Plate"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hoe"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The keyboard is one of the main parts of a computer."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O2','We use a mobile phone mainly to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Make calls and send messages"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cook food"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sweep the floor"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Cut grass"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A mobile phone is used to call people and send messages."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O2','A television is used to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Watch pictures and news"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Wash plates"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Iron clothes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Fetch water"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A television shows moving pictures, news and programmes."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O2','A machine that gives us copies of our work on paper is a:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Printer"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Mouse"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Radio"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Fan"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A printer puts the computer''s work onto paper as a copy."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O2','We can listen to news and music from a:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Radio"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Broom"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Bucket"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Cup"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A radio is used to listen to news, music and other programmes."}',0.2,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','BSC','BSC-T5','BSC-T5-O2','In a Nigerian bank, the machine used to collect cash outside is called:','[{"id": "a", "text": "ATM"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Radio"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fan"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Kettle"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "An ATM (Automated Teller Machine) lets people withdraw cash from the bank."}',0.35,'{P3,BSC,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O1','Which word begins with the same sound as ''ball''?','[{"id": "a", "text": "cat"}, {"id": "b", "text": "book"}, {"id": "c", "text": "dog"}, {"id": "d", "text": "fish"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "''Ball'' and ''book'' both begin with the /b/ sound."}',0.2,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O1','What is the first sound in the word ''sun''?','[{"id": "a", "text": "/s/"}, {"id": "b", "text": "/u/"}, {"id": "c", "text": "/n/"}, {"id": "d", "text": "/t/"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The word ''sun'' starts with the /s/ sound."}',0.2,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O1','Which word starts with the same sound as ''mango''?','[{"id": "a", "text": "rice"}, {"id": "b", "text": "yam"}, {"id": "c", "text": "money"}, {"id": "d", "text": "bread"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "''Mango'' and ''money'' both begin with the /m/ sound."}',0.25,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O1','The word ''goat'' begins with which sound?','[{"id": "a", "text": "/t/"}, {"id": "b", "text": "/o/"}, {"id": "c", "text": "/g/"}, {"id": "d", "text": "/a/"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "''Goat'' starts with the hard /g/ sound."}',0.2,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O1','Which word begins with the same sound as ''table''?','[{"id": "a", "text": "tree"}, {"id": "b", "text": "apple"}, {"id": "c", "text": "leg"}, {"id": "d", "text": "orange"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "''Table'' and ''tree'' both begin with the /t/ sound."}',0.25,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O2','Read this sentence: ''Ada eats rice.'' What does Ada eat?','[{"id": "a", "text": "beans"}, {"id": "b", "text": "rice"}, {"id": "c", "text": "yam"}, {"id": "d", "text": "bread"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The sentence says Ada eats rice."}',0.2,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O2','Read this sentence: ''The dog runs fast.'' What does the dog do?','[{"id": "a", "text": "sleeps"}, {"id": "b", "text": "eats"}, {"id": "c", "text": "runs"}, {"id": "d", "text": "sits"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "The sentence tells us the dog runs fast."}',0.2,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O2','Read this sentence: ''Musa has a red cap.'' What colour is Musa''s cap?','[{"id": "a", "text": "blue"}, {"id": "b", "text": "green"}, {"id": "c", "text": "red"}, {"id": "d", "text": "yellow"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "The sentence says Musa has a red cap."}',0.2,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O2','Read this sentence: ''Ngozi goes to school.'' Where does Ngozi go?','[{"id": "a", "text": "market"}, {"id": "b", "text": "school"}, {"id": "c", "text": "church"}, {"id": "d", "text": "farm"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The sentence says Ngozi goes to school."}',0.2,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T1','ENG-T1-O2','Read this sentence: ''The bird sings in the tree.'' Where is the bird?','[{"id": "a", "text": "on the ground"}, {"id": "b", "text": "in the tree"}, {"id": "c", "text": "in the house"}, {"id": "d", "text": "in the river"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The sentence says the bird sings in the tree."}',0.25,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T2','ENG-T2-O1','Which word in this sentence is a naming word (noun): ''The boy kicks the ball.''?','[{"id": "a", "text": "kicks"}, {"id": "b", "text": "the"}, {"id": "c", "text": "ball"}, {"id": "d", "text": "and"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "''Ball'' is a noun because it names a thing."}',0.25,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T2','ENG-T2-O1','Which of these words is a noun?','[{"id": "a", "text": "jump"}, {"id": "b", "text": "teacher"}, {"id": "c", "text": "happy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "quickly"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "''Teacher'' is a noun because it names a person."}',0.25,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
  ('P3','ENG','ENG-T2','ENG-T2-O1','A noun is a word that names a person, place, animal or thing. Which word names a place?','[{"id": "a", "text": "market"}, {"id": "b", "text": "sing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "fast"}, {"id": "d", "text": "eat"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "''Market'' is a noun because it names a place."}',0.25,'{P3,ENG,nerdc-quiz-seed-v1}'),
